<title>USA: Speedy Muffler King sets $125 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Speedy Muffler King sets $125 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER SPEEDY MUFFLER KING INC/SPEEDY USA INC</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	COUPON 10.875 PCT MATURITY 10/01/06</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES    ISSUE PRICE 100   PAY DATE 04/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B1     SPREAD		PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS   YIELD 10.875 PCT  CALLABLE: AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL AT 35 PERCENT</p>
</text>
